{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50192","headline":"遇崔二[一]有别（伯三八六二下同） · 高适","name":"遇崔二[一]有别（伯三八六二下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大国多任士[二]，（蒋、项皆云「任士」不误，用《庄子·秋水》语。\n）明时遗此人。\n颐颔尚丰盈，毛骨未合迍。\n逸足望千里，商歌悲四隣。\n谁谓多才富，却令家道贫。\n秋风吹别马，携手更伤神。\n（[一]《适集》卷一有「效古赠崔二」，应是一人。\n《赠崔二》有云：「君负纵横才，如何尚顦顇。\n」又云：「穷达自有时，夫子莫下泪。\n」这次「遇崔二」，还是「明时遗此人」，所以还叹息着说「谁谓多才富，却令家道贫！」[二]「任士」刘疑「佳士」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}